16 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (Four network meta-analysis diagrams display group comparisons for quadriceps strength, knee function, quadriceps mass, and quality of life \(QoL\). Each node represents intervention groups\204ET, IKT, PT, BFRT, and CON\204with node size and connecting line thickness indicating the number of comparisons or sample sizes. The thickest lines and largest nodes, especially between BFRT and CON, highlight the most compared groups across diagrams.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Four panels showing cumulative probability line charts comparing five treatments\204BFRT, CON, ET, IKT, and PT\204on quadriceps strength, knee function, quadriceps mass, and four treatments on QoL. Each graph displays a percentage value representing the highest cumulative probability for each treatment in each category.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
